                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 1937,
                            "last_played": 1786251371
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Awesome game, highly recommended for any roguelike enjoyers.  The rudimentary tileset and rock paper scissors interactions might put some off as a bit basic, but beneath it lies a fantastic difficulty curve and fun power-spikey artifacts that will have you coming back for yet another run.  This game was obviously crafted with a lot of love and I am really happy I stumbled upon it.",
